## [ENT-001] | 2026-09-09 13:56 UTC | Neo | error | ref: agentic-brain:reflections/2026-09-09_neo_reference-the-criteria-not-a-second-filter.md | see: 20260909T134526Z
Failure class: competing definitions survive beside a correct source (R8/R20).
